# Podman only (no Docker)

This project uses **Podman** for all local containers. Do not run `docker`, `docker compose`, or `docker ps`.

## Commands

- Start infra: `./scripts/dev/compose.sh up -d postgres redis coturn`
- Check containers: `podman ps`
- Shell into Postgres: `./scripts/dev/psql.sh`
- Dev stack: `./scripts/dev/dev-up.sh` or `./scripts/dev/run-dual-device.sh`

## Testcontainers (backend tests)

Point Testcontainers at Podman on macOS:

```bash
export DOCKER_HOST="unix://$(podman machine inspect --format '{{.ConnectionInfo.PodmanSocket.Path}}')"
cd backend && mvn test
```

## Notes

- `docker-compose.yml` is the Compose file format name — run it via `./scripts/dev/compose.sh`, which wraps `podman compose`.
- Never suggest installing or using Docker Desktop for this repo.
